{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699710/extras/2606a1336fecb3550c954c9e828787f2.avif?t=1747372413\" width=566 height=70 /></span><br><br><strong>I'm definitely going to escape from this house...!</strong><br><br>[Rose and Lotus: Petals of Memories] is based on Korean traditional fairy tales 'Janghwa, Hongryeon'.<br>The main character, Janghwa, awake from the cold floor without her memory.<br>Find the truth behind the dark mansion and get out of it with your sister Hongryeon.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699710/extras/0ba064047b090aa6fb10c02d33824ce4.avif?t=1747372413\" width=566 height=70 /></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Point-and-Click Adventure in the Dark Mansion<br></li><li>A reinterpretation of traditional fairy tales<br></li><li>Unique artwork that varies from room to room<br></li><li>A well-organized configuration of various puzzles.<br></li><li>beautiful background music</li></ul><br><br><strong>How to play:</strong><br>[Rose and Lotus: Petals of Memories] is a point-and-click game.<br>Observation and only the mouse are needed.<br>Click on the placed object -&gt; Zoom in to find hidden clues<br>You must enter the correct answer for the puzzle or apply the item to the correct location.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699710/extras/fd916fa11b0951862093f0539a9fc74c.poster.avif?t=1747372413\" width=566 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699710/extras/fd916fa11b0951862093f0539a9fc74c.webm?t=1747372413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Mission:</strong><br>Rooms are 